# Build artifacts / large binaries — reproducible via scripts/ (see README).
images/*
prebuilt/
*.ko
*.wav
*.bin

# ...EXCEPT the lean RAM-boot image: it's a first-flash TOOL (audio-only initramfs
# you boot from RAM to bootstrap the real flash), not a rebuildable release artifact,
# so it is tracked and referenced by docs/FLASHING-WALKTHROUGH.md. See its sha256 there.
!images/lean-initramfs-kernel.bin

# macOS / editor cruft
.DS_Store

# OTA signing — the private key is never committed (kept off-repo).
*.sec
beep-ota-signing/
.secrets/

# Operator secrets notebook — private, never commit (repo is public)
AGENTS.local.md
